window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I’m in love with my tall, dark and grumpy boss</p> <p>Only he’s engaged to another...</p> <p>Knox Davenport.</p> <p>Six feet three inches of glower, and with a presence that fills any room he walks into, is my boss.</p> <p>Too bad I’m secretly in love with him.</p> <p>He’s a former Marine and the new CEO of the Davenport Group.</p> <p>I'm a lowly assistant.</p> <p>He doesn’t even know my name.</p> <p>I can't get him out of my mind.</p> <p>The man’s obnoxious, and disagreeable and has an ego I want to take down several notches.</p> <p>So why can’t I get over this unreasonable attraction?</p> <p>Besides I need this job so I can pay my bills...and put my siblings through college.</p> <p>I can't do anything to mess up this opportunity.</p> <p>So, I resolve to keep things professional between us.</p> <p>Until he announces he’s to be married... to another.</p> <p>How long can I watch from afar...</p> <p>While my heart breaks apart?</p> <p>I resign my job...</p> <p>I’m sure he’ll forget about me.</p> <p>Only a day later the doorbell rings and he’s there.</p> <p>He's broken off his betrothal.</p> <p>And has a new proposal for me......with conditions...</p> <p>This is Knox &amp; June’s story. A standalone billionaire, one-bed, boss-employee, fake relationship, romance with a strong-willed FMC who’s proud of her curves and won’t settle for anything less than love. It is a complete standalone with a HEA. </p> <p>Tropes</p> <p>Workplace romance</p> <p>Boss - Employee love</p> <p>Marriage of convenience</p> <p>Emotionally wounded military vet hero</p> <p>OTT possessive MCCurvy FMC</p> <p>One bed</p> <p>\"my wife\"</p> <p>\"Who did this to you?\"</p>"; 
